WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.880
ALL OF THE NOMINEES FOR THE

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:04.640
BEST ADAPTED SCREENPLAY ARE
PHENOMENAL.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:09.520
CHLOE ZHAO, BORN IN CHINA AND
RAISED IN THE U.K.,

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:13.360
CAME TO REALIZE THAT
HER EXPERIENCE AS AN OUTSIDER TO

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.600
THE AMERICAN DREAM GAVE HER A
UNIQUE WINDOW INTO EXAMINING IT.

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.520
THAT NICHE PERSPECTIVE DREW HER
TO "NOMADLAND".

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:27.840
RAMIN BAHRANI, NOMINATED FOR
"THE WHITE TIGER,"

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.360
PAID HIS WAY TO MAKING HIS OWN FILMS

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:35.120
WORKING AS A TRUCK DRIVER,
A BARTENDER, AND A TELEMARKETER...

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:39.520
WHOOF, TELEMARKETING.
I MAY HAVE HUNG UP ON YOU A FEW TIMES.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:46.400
KEMP POWERS, HIS OWN PLAY,
"ONE NIGHT IN MIAMI," HE ADAPTED IT.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.280
NOW, THERE'S SOME FUN FACTS IN
THE TELEPROMPTER,

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.800
BUT I'M GONNA GO OFF SCRIPT HERE.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:57.840
THIS WAS HIS FIRST SCREENPLAY.
BEFORE, KEMP WAS A PLAYWRIGHT,

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:01.920
HE WAS A JOURNALIST,
AND ONE OF HIS FAVORITE FILMS

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:05.680
IS "ANIMAL HOUSE," WHICH IS WHERE HE
HEARD SAM COOKE FOR THE FIRST TIME.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.040
HOW ABOUT THAT?

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:11.280
FLORIAN ZELLER, ADAPTING HIS
PLAY "THE FATHER,"

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:13.760
SAW THE MOVIE "RAIN MAN,"
AND WAS INSPIRED

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:17.280
TO CREATE A CHARACTER
THAT ALLOWS US TO UNDERSTAND

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:20.160
ALZHEIMER'S THROUGH THE EYES
OF THOSE LIVING IT.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.920
HIS COLLABORATOR,
CHRISTOPHER HAMPTON

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.000
WAS RAISED IN CAIRO, EGYPT

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.880
AND HIS MOVIE LOVE STEMS
FROM HIS FATHER TAKING HIM

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:32.080
TO THE MOVIES
THREE TIMES A WEEK!
&nbsp;

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.720
I BET TICKETS WEREN'T
$13 APIECE BACK THEN.

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.920
OKAY, HERE WE GO:

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:44.320
SACHA BARON COHEN, DAN MAZER,
DAN SWIMER, ERICA RIVINOJA,

00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.640
JENA FRIEDMAN, ANTHONY HINES,
LEE KERN, PETER BAYNHAM,

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:52.640
AND NINA PEDRAD FOR
"BORAT SUBSEQUENT MOVIEFILM:

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:56.800
DELIVERY OF PRODIGIOUS BRIBE TO
AMERICAN REGIME FOR MAKE BENEFIT

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.360
ONCE GLORIOUS NATION OF KAZAKHSTAN."

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:02.560
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.840
OKAY.
HERE WE GO.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:09.400
AND THE OSCAR GOES TO --

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.400
CHRISTOPHER HAMPTON
AND FLORIAN ZELLER

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:21.840
"THE FATHER".

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:27.600
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.520
THANK YOU,
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:32.640
IT'S SUCH A GREAT JOY AND
SUCH A GREAT HONOR.

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:35.360
AND I SHARE THESE JOYS
AND THIS AWARD

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:39.280
WITH CHRISTOPHER HAMPTON.
WE HAVE WORKED TOGETHER FOR YEARS

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:42.800
AND I WANT TO THANK HIM
FOR BEING SUCH A GREAT WRITER

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.480
AND SUCH A WONDERFUL FRIEND

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:47.600
AND I HAVE TO THANK EVERYONE
INVOLVED IN "THE FATHER"

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.080
AND EVERYONE WHO HELPED
ME TO MAKE THAT FILM,

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:53.120
UH, THAT SCRIPT,
BECOMING A FILM.

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:56.000
MY PRODUCERS, OF COURSE.
SIMON FRIEND

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:58.560
WHO FIRST PRODUCED
THE PLAY IN LONDON.

00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:01.360
THE GREAT DAVID PARFITT,
PHILIPPE CARCASSONNE,

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.560
JEAN-LOUIS LIVI,
CHRISTOPHE SPADONE

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:10.720
THE SONY CLASSICS FAMILY
MICHAEL, TOM, MELODY

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.760
ALL MY TEAM AT CAA:
BRYAN, SORRY,

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:16.160
SO MANY NAMES THAT
I HAVE TO MENTION.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:20.000
FREDERICA, CHRIS, ANDREW,
LAURENT, OLIVIER, SUZANNE

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.680
THANK YOU FOR BEING
SO SUPPORTIVE.

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:24.320
AND THE CREW OF
"THE FATHER," OF COURSE

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:27.760
AND THE WONDERFUL CAST:
OLIVIA WILLIAMS, OLIVIA COLMAN

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:32.160
RUFUS SEWELL, MARK GATISS,
IMOGEN POOTS, AND OF COURSE,

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:33.520
ANTHONY HOPKINS.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:35.200
I WROTE THIS SCRIPT FOR HIM.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:39.200
TO ME, HE'S THE
GREATEST LIVING ACTOR.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:42.800
AND JUST THE IDEA TO WORK
WITH HIM WAS LIKE A DREAM.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:45.520
AND I KNEW THAT IT WAS NOT
AN EASY DREAM TO FULFILL

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.920
BECAUSE I'M FRENCH,
AS YOU CAN HEAR.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.240
IT WAS MY FIRST FEATURE FILM,
AND, YOU KNOW,

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:51.920
HE'S ANTHONY HOPKINS.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.760
BUT I THOUGHT, UNTIL
SOMEONE COMES

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.960
AND PROVES THAT IT WAS
NOT POSSIBLE, IT MEANS THAT

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.320
POTENTIALLY IT IS.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.280
AND SOMETIMES WE ARE
THE ONE WHO CLOSE THE DOOR

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:03.360
OF WHAT IS POSSIBLE
AND WHAT IS NOT POSSIBLE

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:05.600
AND FOR "THE FATHER,"
I REALLY WANTED NOT TO

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.480
CLOSE THAT DOOR
AND TO FOLLOW MY INSPIRATION,

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.000
MY DESIRE, AND MY DREAM.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:14.000
SO, THANK YOU, ANTHONY,
FOR HAVING SAID YES TO THAT SCRIPT.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.440
AND THANK YOU FOR GIVING
EVERYTHING TO THAT FILM.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:21.120
YOUR ENERGY, YOUR GRACE,
AND YOUR TALENT.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:25.440
SHARING THAT JOURNEY WITH YOU
WAS THE MOST AMAZING

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:27.520
EXPERIENCE OF MY LIFE.

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:30.960
AND AT LAST, I WANT TO
THANK MY WIFE, MARINE,

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:34.480
FOR SUPPORTING ME
WITH LOVE AND PATIENCE.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:41.840
UH, THANK YOU TO THE ACADEMY.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:49.736
[ APPLAUSE ]

